  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nThe equation:\n\n[ {15 + ( {5 × 4} )} ] ÷ ( {5 + 2} ) + [ {20 - ( {(3)/(5) of 15} )} ]\n\n**Concept Used:**\n\nFollow BODMAS rule to solve this question, as per the order given below.\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/0b6ca2a7a1fc0ba2035e77f7ca92cf06444673b8882751382348c5d195b17efb.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n[ {15 + ( {5 × 4} )} ] ÷ ( {5 + 2} ) + [ {20 - ( {(3)/(5) of 15} )} ]\n\n⇒ (15 + 20) ÷ 7 + (20 – 9)\n\n⇒ 35 ÷ 7 + 11\n\n⇒ 5 + 11 \n\n⇒ 16\n\n**∴ [ {15 + ( {5 × 4} )} ] ÷ ( {5 + 2} ) + [ {20 - ( {(3)/(5) of 15} )} ] = 16**\n\n9e:T",
